115
00:08:46.764 --> 00:08:47.639
Part 2.

116
00:08:47.919 --> 00:08:49.796
Core Concepts, Beginner to Deep.

117
00:08:51.046 --> 00:08:53.798
Intuition: a new support agent with a binder.

118
00:08:54.078 --> 00:08:57.491
Imagine hiring a brilliant support agent on their first day.

119
00:08:57.771 --> 00:09:03.574
They know language and general facts, but nothing about your refund policy or this customer's order.

120
00:09:03.854 --> 00:09:12.515
So you hand them a binder: before answering, they look up the relevant pages (retrieval), read them (the prompt), and answer from them (generation).

121
00:09:12.795 --> 00:09:25.830
For anything that changes money or orders, they don't act on their own: they fill in a form that a supervisor checks (the policy layer), and they never follow instructions written on a customer's letter (prompt injection).

122
00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:40.425
The binder's index quality decides whether they find the right page; the size of the pages decides whether the answer fits on what they read; and how many customers one agent can serve at once decides how many agents you hire (serving).

123
00:09:41.775 --> 00:09:42.735
Requirements.

124
00:09:43.015 --> 00:09:43.868
Functional.

125
00:09:44.148 --> 00:09:52.468
Answer policy, product, recipe and order questions in English, Hindi and Hinglish, grounded in platform data, with citations.

126
00:09:52.748 --> 00:09:59.447
Take actions through tools: track, cancel (before packing), refund (within policy), with the user's confirmation.

127
00:09:59.727 --> 00:10:06.191
Stream answers token by token; remember the conversation; hand off to a human agent on request.

128
00:10:06.471 --> 00:10:07.580
Non-functional.

129
00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:18.765
Latency: time to first token (TTFT) p99 at most 2 s; streaming ≥ 20 tokens per second per user.

130
00:10:19.045 --> 00:10:25.317
Quality: answers grounded in retrieved sources; measured on a judged eval set before every change.

131
00:10:25.597 --> 00:10:32.103
Safety: no action without the user's intent and ownership; no data from one customer shown to another.

132
00:10:32.383 --> 00:10:37.887
Cost: a budget per conversation; degrade (smaller model, shorter context) before failing.

133
00:10:39.237 --> 00:10:46.021
Availability: answers keep working when a model provider is down (fallback model or I can't do that right now).

134
00:10:47.371 --> 00:10:48.417
