00:25:48.525 --> 00:26:02.882
Context, v1 answered wrongly from bloated chunks, missed SKU codes, cost 38 lakh rupees per month, melted at dinner time, and paid a refund requested by a planted product review (twice, after a retry).

375
00:26:03.162 --> 00:26:25.370
Decision, Hybrid retrieval with 120-word chunks, RRF and a re-ranker; a model gateway routing easy turns to a self-hosted small model on a continuous-batching engine with paged KV and prefix caching, hard turns to a provider model; a keyed response cache for non-personal answers; a policy layer in front of every tool.

376
00:26:26.720 --> 00:26:41.781
Related ADRs, ADR-620 Retrieval: hybrid BM25 + vectors, RRF k=60, judged eval set of 1,200 questions gates every index change (L1).

377
00:26:42.061 --> 00:26:55.501
ADR-621 Serving: engine with continuous batching, paged KV, prefix cache; autoscale on queue depth and KV use; TTFT p99 at most 2 s (L2).

378
00:26:55.781 --> 00:27:05.979
ADR-622 Caching: key = intent + entities + scope; personal intents never cached; no semantic-similarity cache (L3).

379
00:27:06.259 --> 00:27:17.629
ADR-623 Tools: intent allow-list from the user's words, ownership and policy checks, idempotency keys, UI-rendered confirmation for money (L4).

