00:35:01.020 --> 00:35:03.793
TTFT p99 = 2 s.

468
00:35:04.073 --> 00:35:04.692
A.

469
00:35:04.972 --> 00:35:45.969
Load sweep (requests per second offered to one GPU): time to first token (TTFT) and goodput. policy req per second TTFT p50 TTFT p99 tokens per second avg batch. one at a time 0.1 53ms 21653ms 19 1.0. one at a time 4.0 332126ms 60 s 44 1.0. one at a time 9.0 344413ms 60 s 44 1.0. static batch of 16

